      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b2",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Want to turn your generative AI ideas into real web applications with one click?",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b3",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Any developer knows it\u2019s a complex process to build shareable, interactive applications: you have to set up infrastructure, wire APIs, and build a front-end. It's usually a complex process. What if you could skip the heavy lifting and turn your generative AI concept into a working web app with just a few clicks?",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b4",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Today, we're thrilled to introduce a streamlined workflow within Google Cloud's Vertex AI: one-click deployment of your generative AI prompts directly to Cloud Run as interactive web applications. We\u2019ll show you how it works, and how you can get started.",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b5",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Vertex AI provides a helpful environment for experimenting with and refining generative AI prompts. You can test different models, tune parameters, and craft the perfect instructions. However, sharing that interactive experience beyond the console often means exporting code, setting up hosting, managing dependencies, and building a user interface.",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b6",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Finding the right path to deployment isn't always straightforward. The missing piece \u2013 a clear option to transform the prompt into a shareable prototype.",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b7",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Based on this feedback and our goal to make generative AI accessible, we've integrated a seamless deployment path:",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b8",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Customize with Cloud Run",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b9",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Your app is deployed to Cloud Run, Google Cloud's fully-managed application platform. This means you get automatic scaling (including to zero for cost savings) without managing infrastructure \u2013 perfect for quickly deploying and sharing your apps. . To customize your app and take it to production, you can edit the application code directly in Cloud Run\u2019s source editor to make it your own. You can also download the code, and use your IDE of choice, pushing updates with Cloud Run\u2019s git integration.",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b10",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Why this matters:",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
      "items": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "list_start_number": null,
      "image_id_ref": null,
      "gcs_url": null,
      "alt_text": null,
      "caption": null,
      "llm_description": null,
      "width": null,
      "height": null
    },
    {
      "block_id": "e2e_job_58d9b966_b12",
      "tmp_id": null,
      "user_id": null,
      "document_id": null,
      "type": "text",
      "order_index": null,
      "content": "Ready to bring your generative AI ideas to life? Head over to Vertex AI Studio in the Google Cloud console and look for the \"Deploy as App\" button. We can't wait to see what you build!",
      "page_number": null,
      "bbox": null,
      "level": null,
      "language": null,
